"For full details, look at the `COPYRIGHT.txt <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/master/COPYRIGHT.txt>`_ as well as the `LICENSE.txt <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/master/LICENSE.txt>`_ and "
