"méthodes et les propriétés des types de nœuds intégrés de Godot."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/class_reference/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"To learn to submit your changes to the Godot project using the Git version "
"control system, see `Class reference contribution documentation <https://"
"contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/documentation/"
